#: ../../content/applications/productivity/activities.rst:5
msgid "The **Activities** app extends the :doc:`activities <../essentials/activities>` scheduled on records with a dedicated board, reminders, recurring activities, and a 360° history per customer."
msgstr "La aplicación **Actividades** amplía las :doc:`actividades <../essentials/activities>` programadas en los registros con un tablero dedicado, recordatorios, actividades recurrentes e historial de 360° por cliente."

#: ../../content/applications/productivity/activities.rst:9
msgid "The app is provided by the *Activities* (``activity``) module, with bridge modules for the other apps: *Activities - CRM* (``activity_crm``), *Activities - Repair* (``activity_repair``), *Activities - Calendar* (``activity_calendar``)."
msgstr "La aplicación la proporciona el módulo *Activities* (``activity``), con módulos puente para las demás aplicaciones: *Activities - CRM* (``activity_crm``), *Activities - Repair* (``activity_repair``), *Activities - Calendar* (``activity_calendar``)."

#: ../../content/applications/productivity/activities.rst:14 ../../content/applications/productivity/appointments.rst:22 ../../content/applications/productivity/dashboards/custom_dashboards.rst:19 ../../content/applications/productivity/discuss/mailbox.rst:73 ../../content/applications/productivity/documents.rst:15 ../../content/applications/productivity/knowledge.rst:13
msgid "Access rights"
msgstr "Permisos de acceso"

#: ../../content/applications/productivity/activities.rst:16
msgid "The :guilabel:`Activities` category of the :ref:`access rights <access-rights/users>` offers three levels:"
msgstr "La categoría :guilabel:`Actividades` de los :ref:`permisos de acceso <access-rights/users>` ofrece tres niveles:"

#: ../../content/applications/productivity/activities.rst:19
msgid ":guilabel:`User`: sees and manages their own activities;"
msgstr ":guilabel:`Usuario`: ve y gestiona sus propias actividades;"

#: ../../content/applications/productivity/activities.rst:20
msgid ":guilabel:`Supervisor`: additionally sees the activities they supervise;"
msgstr ":guilabel:`Supervisor`: además, ve las actividades que supervisa;"

#: ../../content/applications/productivity/activities.rst:21
msgid ":guilabel:`Manager`: sees all activities and configures the app."
msgstr ":guilabel:`Manager`: ve todas las actividades y configura la aplicación."

#: ../../content/applications/productivity/activities.rst:24
msgid "The activity board"
msgstr "El tablero de actividades"

#: ../../content/applications/productivity/activities.rst:26
msgid "The app groups the activities of the database in a single place:"
msgstr "La aplicación agrupa las actividades de la base de datos en un solo lugar:"

#: ../../content/applications/productivity/activities.rst:28
msgid ":menuselection:`Activities --> My Activities`: the activities assigned to the user;"
msgstr ":menuselection:`Actividades --> Mis actividades`: las actividades asignadas al usuario;"

#: ../../content/applications/productivity/activities.rst:29
msgid ":menuselection:`Activities --> Supervised Activities`: the activities whose :guilabel:`Supervisor` is the user;"
msgstr ":menuselection:`Actividades --> Actividades supervisadas`: las actividades cuyo :guilabel:`Supervisor` es el usuario;"

#: ../../content/applications/productivity/activities.rst:31
msgid ":menuselection:`Activities --> All Activities`: every activity (managers only)."
msgstr ":menuselection:`Actividades --> Todas las actividades`: todas las actividades (solo gestores)."

#: ../../content/applications/productivity/activities.rst:33
msgid "Besides the standard fields, an activity carries a :guilabel:`Supervisor`, :guilabel:`Tags`, a :guilabel:`Priority`, a :guilabel:`Feedback` and, when it is cancelled, a :guilabel:`Cancel Reason`. Its status is shown as :guilabel:`Overdue`, :guilabel:`Today`, :guilabel:`Planned`, :guilabel:`Done`, or :guilabel:`Cancelled`."
msgstr "Además de los campos estándar, una actividad tiene un :guilabel:`Supervisor`, :guilabel:`Etiquetas`, una :guilabel:`Prioridad`, unos :guilabel:`Comentarios` y, cuando se cancela, un :guilabel:`Motivo de cancelación`. Su estado se muestra como :guilabel:`Atrasada`, :guilabel:`Hoy`, :guilabel:`Planificada`, :guilabel:`Hecha` o :guilabel:`Cancelada`."

#: ../../content/applications/productivity/activities.rst:46
msgid "Multiple assignees"
msgstr "Varios responsables asignados"

#: ../../content/applications/productivity/activities.rst:48
msgid "When :guilabel:`Multiple Assignees` is enabled in :menuselection:`Settings --> Activities`, an activity can be assigned to several users at once. Each of them then gets their own copy of the activity, so everyone can complete their part separately."
msgstr "Cuando se activa :guilabel:`Varios responsables` en :menuselection:`Ajustes --> Actividades`, una actividad se puede asignar a varios usuarios a la vez. Cada uno de ellos recibe entonces su propia copia de la actividad, de modo que todos puedan completar su parte por separado."

#: ../../content/applications/productivity/activities.rst:55
msgid "Tags classify activities across models. Manage them in :menuselection:`Activities --> Configuration --> Tags`, where each tag has a :guilabel:`Name` and a :guilabel:`Color`."
msgstr "Las etiquetas clasifican las actividades entre modelos. Gestiónelas en :menuselection:`Actividades --> Configuración --> Etiquetas`, donde cada etiqueta tiene un :guilabel:`Nombre` y un :guilabel:`Color`."

#: ../../content/applications/productivity/activities.rst:59 ../../content/applications/productivity/sign.rst:472
msgid "Reminders"
msgstr "Recordatorios"

#: ../../content/applications/productivity/activities.rst:61
msgid "A **reminder** notifies the assignee before the activity is due. Create reminders in :menuselection:`Activities --> Configuration --> Reminders`, with a :guilabel:`Type` (e-mail or notification), a :guilabel:`Remind Before` value and its :guilabel:`Reminder Unit`, and optionally a :guilabel:`Custom Notification Template`. Then add the reminders to an activity in its :guilabel:`Alarms` field."
msgstr "Un **recordatorio** notifica al responsable antes de que venza la actividad. Cree recordatorios en :menuselection:`Actividades --> Configuración --> Recordatorios`, con un :guilabel:`Tipo` (correo electrónico o notificación), un valor de :guilabel:`Recordar antes de` y su :guilabel:`Unidad de recordatorio`, y opcionalmente una :guilabel:`Plantilla de notificación personalizada`. Después, añada los recordatorios a una actividad en su campo :guilabel:`Alarmas`."

#: ../../content/applications/productivity/activities.rst:67
msgid "Reminders are sent by a scheduled action, and only when :guilabel:`Activity Reminders` is enabled in :menuselection:`Settings --> Activities`."
msgstr "Los recordatorios se envían mediante una acción planificada, y solo cuando :guilabel:`Recordatorios de actividades` está activado en :menuselection:`Ajustes --> Actividades`."

#: ../../content/applications/productivity/activities.rst:71
msgid "Due date notifications"
msgstr "Notificaciones de fecha límite"

#: ../../content/applications/productivity/activities.rst:73
msgid "In :menuselection:`Settings --> Activities`, the :guilabel:`Due Activity Notifications` block sends daily mails around the due date of the activities: on the due date, one or two notices before it, and one or two notices after it, each with the number of days to apply. Each notice can also be copied to the user who created the activity."
msgstr "En :menuselection:`Ajustes --> Actividades`, el bloque :guilabel:`Notificaciones de actividades vencidas` envía correos diarios en torno a la fecha límite de las actividades: en la fecha límite, uno o dos avisos antes de ella y uno o dos avisos después, cada uno con el número de días a aplicar. Cada aviso también se puede copiar al usuario que creó la actividad."

#: ../../content/applications/productivity/activities.rst:78
msgid ":guilabel:`Overdue Activity Escalation` notifies the supervisor when an activity stays overdue longer than the configured number of days."
msgstr ":guilabel:`Escalado de actividades atrasadas` notifica al supervisor cuando una actividad permanece atrasada más tiempo del número de días configurado."

#: ../../content/applications/productivity/activities.rst:89
msgid "Recurring activities"
msgstr "Actividades recurrentes"

#: ../../content/applications/productivity/activities.rst:91
msgid "A recurring activity recreates itself on a schedule. Configure them in :menuselection:`Activities --> Configuration --> Recurring Activities`:"
msgstr "Una actividad recurrente se vuelve a crear según una planificación. Configúrelas en :menuselection:`Actividades --> Configuración --> Actividades recurrentes`:"

#: ../../content/applications/productivity/activities.rst:94
msgid ":guilabel:`Repeat Every`: the interval and its unit;"
msgstr ":guilabel:`Repetir cada`: el intervalo y su unidad;"

#: ../../content/applications/productivity/activities.rst:95
msgid "the days of the week, the :guilabel:`Date of Month`, or the month, depending on the recurrence type chosen;"
msgstr "los días de la semana, la :guilabel:`Fecha del mes` o el mes, según el tipo de recurrencia elegido;"

#: ../../content/applications/productivity/activities.rst:97
msgid ":guilabel:`Repeat` or :guilabel:`End Date`: how the recurrence ends;"
msgstr ":guilabel:`Repetir` o :guilabel:`Fecha de finalización`: cómo termina la recurrencia;"

#: ../../content/applications/productivity/activities.rst:98
msgid "the :guilabel:`Summary`, :guilabel:`Description`, :guilabel:`Tags`, the assignee, and the :guilabel:`Supervisor` given to each generated activity;"
msgstr "el :guilabel:`Resumen`, la :guilabel:`Descripción`, las :guilabel:`Etiquetas`, el responsable asignado y el :guilabel:`Supervisor` asignados a cada actividad generada;"

#: ../../content/applications/productivity/activities.rst:100
msgid ":guilabel:`Start After Days`: the delay before the first activity is created."
msgstr ":guilabel:`Iniciar después de (días)`: el retraso antes de que se cree la primera actividad."

#: ../../content/applications/productivity/activities.rst:103
msgid "Activity history"
msgstr "Historial de actividades"

#: ../../content/applications/productivity/activities.rst:105
msgid ":menuselection:`Activities --> Activity History` gives a 360° view of every activity — open and completed — with its :guilabel:`Customer`, :guilabel:`Company`, :guilabel:`Assigned To`, :guilabel:`Supervisor`, :guilabel:`Activity Type`, :guilabel:`Due Date`, :guilabel:`Summary`, and :guilabel:`Feedback`. The same history is available from a contact, in :menuselection:`Contacts --> Activity History`."
msgstr ":menuselection:`Actividades --> Historial de actividades` ofrece una vista de 360° de cada actividad, abierta o completada, con su :guilabel:`Cliente`, :guilabel:`Empresa`, :guilabel:`Asignado a`, :guilabel:`Supervisor`, :guilabel:`Tipo de actividad`, :guilabel:`Fecha límite`, :guilabel:`Resumen` y :guilabel:`Comentarios`. El mismo historial está disponible desde un contacto, en :menuselection:`Contactos --> Historial de actividades`."

#: ../../content/applications/productivity/activities.rst:112
msgid "Reporting"
msgstr "Informes"

#: ../../content/applications/productivity/activities.rst:114
msgid ":guilabel:`My Reporting` and :guilabel:`Reporting` analyze the activities of the user, or of everyone, by type, assignee, supervisor, or period."
msgstr ":guilabel:`Mis informes` y :guilabel:`Informes` analizan las actividades del usuario, o de todos, por tipo, responsable, supervisor o periodo."

#: ../../content/applications/productivity/activities.rst:118
msgid "Deletion log"
msgstr "Registro de eliminaciones"

#: ../../content/applications/productivity/activities.rst:120
msgid "Every deleted activity leaves a trace in :menuselection:`Activities --> Configuration --> Deletion Log`, with the document it belonged to, its summary, its assignee, its due date, who deleted it, when, and the :guilabel:`Removal Reason`. This makes it possible to see what was planned on a record even after the activity is gone."
msgstr "Cada actividad eliminada deja un rastro en :menuselection:`Actividades --> Configuración --> Registro de eliminaciones`, con el documento al que pertenecía, su resumen, su responsable, su fecha límite, quién la eliminó, cuándo, y el :guilabel:`Motivo de eliminación`. Esto permite ver lo que estaba planificado en un registro incluso después de que la actividad haya desaparecido."

#: ../../content/applications/productivity/activities.rst:126
msgid "In a multi-company database, the *Activity Multi-Company Fix* (``activity_multicompany``) module prevents access errors on activities belonging to another company."
msgstr "En una base de datos multiempresa, el módulo *Activity Multi-Company Fix* (``activity_multicompany``) evita errores de acceso en las actividades que pertenecen a otra empresa."

